    {
      "id": 25,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        1800,
        94
      ],
      "size": [
        560,
        358
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 56,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Help: ENGINE: LTX 2.5",
      "properties": {
        "ue_properties": {
          "widget_ue_connectable": {},
          "version": "7.8",
          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## ENGINE: LTX 2.5\nRenders one shot (start image → end image) per call from the Director. Lightricks LTX 2.5, 22B distilled, int8.\n- **Infinite Movie · Engine Start** (from Director): `start_image`, `end_image`, `prompt`, `seed`, `width`, `height`, `length`.\n- **UNETLoader / VAELoader / CLIPLoader**: LTX 2.5 model, video VAE, audio VAE, Gemma-4 text encoder.\n- **LTXVPreprocess** (×2): prepares the start/end images.\n- **LTXVConditioning + LTXVAddGuide** (×2): conditioning with first/last-frame guides.\n- **SamplerCustomAdvanced + LTXVDualCFGGuider**: 8 steps, manual sigmas.\n- **VAEDecodeTiled**: latent → frames (tiled, saves VRAM).\n- **Infinite Movie · Engine Result** (to Director): the rendered frames.\n- Copy this group into Infinite Movie (Ctrl+C / Ctrl+V) and mute the MiniMax group (Ctrl+M) – only ONE engine group may be active.\n\n**Models** (gated: accept the license on Hugging Face first): [transformer int8](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5/resolve/main/diffusion_models/ltx-2.5-22b-distilled-transformer-comfy-int8-convrot.safetensors) · [Gemma-4 text encoder](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5/resolve/main/text_encoders/gemma4-12b-with-proj-ltx-2.5-comfy-int8-convrot.safetensors) · [video VAE](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5/resolve/main/vae/ltx-2.5-video-vae-bf16.safetensors) · [audio VAE](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5/resolve/main/vae/ltx-2.5-audio-vae-bf16.safetensors)"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## ENGINE: LTX 2.5\nRenders one shot (start image → end image) per call from the Director. Lightricks LTX 2.5, 22B distilled, int8.\n- **Infinite Movie · Engine Start** (from Director): `start_image`, `end_image`, `prompt`, `seed`, `width`, `height`, `length`.\n- **UNETLoader / VAELoader / CLIPLoader**: LTX 2.5 model, video VAE, audio VAE, Gemma-4 text encoder.\n- **LTXVPreprocess** (×2): prepares the start/end images.\n- **LTXVConditioning + LTXVAddGuide** (×2): conditioning with first/last-frame guides.\n- **SamplerCustomAdvanced + LTXVDualCFGGuider**: 8 steps, manual sigmas.\n- **VAEDecodeTiled**: latent → frames (tiled, saves VRAM).\n- **Infinite Movie · Engine Result** (to Director): the rendered frames.\n- Copy this group into Infinite Movie (Ctrl+C / Ctrl+V) and mute the MiniMax group (Ctrl+M) – only ONE engine group may be active.\n\n**Models** (gated: accept the license on Hugging Face first): [transformer int8](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5/resolve/main/diffusion_models/ltx-2.5-22b-distilled-transformer-comfy-int8-convrot.safetensors) · [Gemma-4 text encoder](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5/resolve/main/text_encoders/gemma4-12b-with-proj-ltx-2.5-comfy-int8-convrot.safetensors) · [video VAE](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5/resolve/main/vae/ltx-2.5-video-vae-bf16.safetensors) · [audio VAE](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5/resolve/main/vae/ltx-2.5-audio-vae-bf16.safetensors)"
      },
      "color": "#322",
      "bgcolor": "#533"
    },
